// Deep links: #song=less-is-more&t=45 (seconds), or ?song=less-is-more&t=1:15. The address tracks playback for sharing.
// Page source; background: bg.jpg. Build with: scroll build
// Photo: Duke University East Campus Union, June 2006. Bluedog423. Released into the public domain.
